{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47318","headline":"经羊角哀墓作 · 吴筠","name":"经羊角哀墓作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只召出江国，路傍旌古坟。\n伯桃葬角哀，墓近荆将军。\n神道不相得，称兵解其纷。\n幽明信难知，胜负理莫分。\n长呼遂刎颈，此节古未闻。\n两贤结情爱，骨肉何足云。\n感子初并粮，我心正氛氲。\n迟回驻征骑，不觉空林醺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}